kind: llman.sdd.spec
name: "yaml-dsl-lsp-cli"
purpose: "提供一个跨编辑器可复用的 YAML DSL LSP server 启动入口（默认 stdio），并约束其日志/降级行为， 以保证编辑器集成稳定且可排障。 [scope-review-2026-07-12-c5-openpyxl-helpers]"
valid_scope[1]: src/scalim/
requirements[4]{req_id,title,statement}:
  r1,"CLI MUST provide a stable `scalim-yaml-dsl-lsp serve` entrypoint (stdio by defau","系统 MUST 提供一个稳定的 server 启动入口，供任意 LSP client 通过一个命令拉起： - MUST 提供命令：`scalim-yaml-dsl-lsp serve` - MUST 默认以 stdio 模式运行（stdout/stderr 分离；stdout 仅用于 JSON-RPC） - MAY 提供 `--tcp` 模式（仅用于 debug；不作为 v1 必选） - MUST 支持配置日志输出到 stderr 或文件（不得写入 stdout）"
  r2,"serve initialization failure MUST be diagnosable and MUST NOT emit partial JSON-","当 server 依赖缺失或初始化失败时，系统 MUST： - MUST 以非 0 exit code 退出 - MUST 在 stderr 输出可诊断的错误信息 - MUST NOT 在 stdout 输出半截 JSON-RPC（不得污染 LSP client 通道） - stderr 的错误信息 MUST 包含可执行的修复提示示例，且至少覆盖两条路径： - **installed 修复**：重新安装 `scalim-yaml-dsl-lsp` 以补齐依赖（例如 `uv tool install scalim-yaml-dsl-lsp`） - **ephemeral 修复**：使用 `uvx` 一键启动（例如 `uvx scalim-yaml-dsl-lsp serve --log-level INFO`）"
  r3,"CLI MUST provide a `dump-discovery` troubleshooting entrypoint","系统 MUST 提供一个排障入口用于导出 project discovery 摘要（便于用户自助诊断或粘贴到 issue）： - MUST 提供命令：`scalim-yaml-dsl-lsp dump-discovery <yaml_path> --json` - MUST 输出 JSON payload（至少包含 `project_root/scalim_yaml_path/python_roots/allowed_yaml_roots`） - MUST 为静态无副作用（仅文件系统读取与解析；不得执行用户代码）"
  r4,Serve contract MUST include a troubleshooting entrypoint,"系统 MUST 提供可排障入口，用于让用户确认当前 workspace 的 project discovery 摘要： - project_root - scalim_yaml_path（可为空） - python_roots - allowed_yaml_roots 该信息 MUST 可通过日志或可查询命令获得（实现形式由 design 决定）。"
scenarios[8]{req_id,id,given,when,then}:
  r1,baseline,"","TODO: describe the trigger","TODO: describe the expected result"
  r1,"server-is-started-via-stdio-without-log-pollution","用户在终端执行 `scalim-yaml-dsl-lsp serve`",LSP client 与 server 通过 stdio 交互,"stdout MUST 仅包含 JSON-RPC payload"
  r2,baseline,"","TODO: describe the trigger","TODO: describe the expected result"
  r2,"missing-server-dependency-yields-clean-failure","环境已安装 `scalim-yaml-dsl-lsp`，但运行时依赖缺失（例如安装时使用了 `--no-deps` 导致缺少 `pygls`）","用户执行 `scalim-yaml-dsl-lsp serve`",进程 MUST 立即失败并返回非 0
  r3,baseline,"","TODO: describe the trigger","TODO: describe the expected result"
  r3,"dump-discovery-returns-a-json-summary-for-an-arbitrary-yaml-",用户有一个 YAML 文件 `demo.yaml`,"执行 `scalim-yaml-dsl-lsp dump-discovery demo.yaml --json`",stdout MUST 输出一个 JSON 对象
  r4,baseline,"","TODO: describe the trigger","TODO: describe the expected result"
  r4,"user-can-obtain-discovery-summary-for-an-issue-report","",用户按文档执行排障步骤,用户 MUST 能获得 discovery 摘要并可粘贴到 issue